    "Id": "chassisdef_catapult_iii_CPLT-R2",
    "Name": "Catapult",
    "Details": "With great effort, RISC Engineers upgraded the Catapult II chassis to an Omnimech level of technology. Employing the most advanced equipment at their disposal, this venerable design's weight was reduced to 55 tons without sacrificing any firepower. This configuration relies on a pair of highly accurate streak MRM launchers, backed by armor-stripping medium lasers. As with most of this line, it is protected by a laser anti-missile system built directly into the armor plating.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Experimental TC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
